# ISDN: Linking the Information Highway to the Classroom.

**Authors:** Fox, John, And Others

## Abstract
Describes the Integrated Services Digital Network (ISDN), a digital telecommunications system. Applications of ISDN in the classroom are examined, including information systems such as computers and fax machines; video conferencing; desktop computer conferencing; and voice messaging and caller identification. Cost estimates are also included. (Contains 11 references.) (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ471222

